#: providers/models/anthropic/llm/schemas/claude_2.py:22
#: providers/models/anthropic/llm/schemas/claude_2_1.py:22
#: providers/models/anthropic/llm/schemas/claude_3_5_haiku_20241022.py:25
#: providers/models/anthropic/llm/schemas/claude_3_5_sonnet_20240620.py:25
#: providers/models/anthropic/llm/schemas/claude_3_5_sonnet_20241022.py:25
