msgstr "输入你的 API 基础地址，例如 https://api.openai.com"

#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4.py:36
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_0125_preview.py:36
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_1106_preview.py:36
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_32k.py:36
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_turbo.py:37
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_turbo_2024_04_09.py:37
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_turbo_preview.py:36
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_vision_preview.py:34
msgid "Seed"
msgstr "种子"

#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4.py:38
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_0125_preview.py:38
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_1106_preview.py:38
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_32k.py:38
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_turbo_2024_04_09.py:39
msgid ""
"If specified, model will make a best effort to sample deterministically, "
"such that repeated requests with the same seed and parameters should "
"return the same result.Determinism is not guaranteed, and you should "
"refer to the system_fingerprint response parameter"
msgstr ""
"如果指定，模型将尽最大努力进行确定性采样，使得具有相同种子和参数的重复请求应返回相同的结果。确定性不能保证，你应该参考 "
"system_fingerprint 响应参数"

#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_turbo.py:39
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_turbo_preview.py:38
#: providers/models/openai/llm/schemas/gpt_4_vision_preview.py:36
msgid ""
"If specified, model will make a best effort to sample deterministically, "
"such that repeated requests with the same seed and parameters should "
"return the same result. Determinism is not guaranteed, and you should "
"refer to the system_fingerprint response parameter to monitor changes in "
"the backend."
msgstr ""
"如果指定，模型将尽最大努力进行确定性采样，使得具有相同种子和参数的重复请求应返回相同的结果。确定性不能保证，你应该参考 "
"system_fingerprint 响应参数来监控后端的变化。"

